  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mine Action and Cluster Munitions Programme-Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This humanitarian mine action project will be implemented over a period of 48 months, from 1 September 2020 &#x2013; 31 August 2024. Through a combination of land release and explosive ordnance risk education activities, and supporting the development of a sustainable national capacity, the project will contribute to reducing the threat to life and improving mobility, access to services and livelihoods in target communities.</narrative>
  </description>
